I know several people have asked about the file system design changes being=
 pushed for Witherspoon and the related code update plans.  Attached is som=
e much belated documentation of the current design, and the new design prop=
osal being implemented.  It also includes some history of how the current s=
ystem came to be, some documentation of the existing init ram Fs scripts, a=
 glossary of terms, and describes the boot process at some levels.  Not to =
forget, limitations and some motivations are provided.

Download and enjoy some time reading.  Feedback welcome

Milton

